  <item>
    <title>34.我们终于长大，然后开始怀念</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/690b05abaf4fc00da73c1c15</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">690b05abaf4fc00da73c1c15</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Nov 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>小时候，我们总盼望着长大</span></p><span></span><p><span>长大后，又开始怀念小时候</span></p><span></span><p><span>成长是一个瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span>还是一步一脚印</span></p><span></span><p><span>请坚持听到最后</span></p><span></span><p><span>三位主播首次温情时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span>给曾经的自己写了一封信</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天让我们坐上这台时光机</span></p><span></span><p><span>回望过去，珍惜现在，追问未来</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="146">02:26</a> 哪些瞬间让我们领悟到了自己长大了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1597">26:37</a> 那些长大后才读懂的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2730">45:30</a> 更怀念小时候还是更喜欢长大后？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3263">54:23</a> 三位主播分别写了一封信给小时候的自己</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期歌单】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Nothing Sweeter-Naomi Sharon</span></p><span></span><p><span>巴太与小马-高小阳</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、Apple Podcasts、荔枝、蜻蜓FM、QQ音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>490368444@qq.com</span></p>]]></description>
