  <item>
    <title>33.倒闭吧！中国移动</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6901b1e5558113deb7fd8fbd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6901b1e5558113deb7fd8fbd</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目又是一期大吐槽</span></p><span></span><p><span>三位主播真的是受了不少移动的气</span></p><span></span><p><span>于是真情实感的抒发了很多“肺腑之言”</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们日常工作竟然也有很多需要和移动公司对接的部分</span></p><span></span><p><span>没想到对方公司的不作为也徒增了我们不少的工作量</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家扫描下方二维码，或wx搜索Mycxyxb，添加小助手，拉你进听友群</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fri-T44MGfmTf3ZpBPNVo1AxlT2R.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">01:21</a> 由于营业厅工作人员和10086话务员的不专业，我差点被坑100多话费</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 和单位对接的移动营业厅的经理跟没睡醒似的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1398">23:18</a> 总爱在别人最忙的时候横插一脚，求人办事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1468">24:28</a> 从移动公司活动通知的转发者 变成被咨询人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1782">29:42</a> 急需要移动工作人员解决紧急问题的时候他们在过周末</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2368">39:28</a> 通过好评可以拒绝很多移动的骚扰电话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2562">42:42</a> 原来和移动公司的恩怨情仇都是主任招来的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2898">48:18</a> 移动推销套充满了陷阱</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期歌单】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Untitled（How Does It feel）-D’Angelo</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、Apple Podcasts、荔枝、蜻蜓FM、QQ音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>490368444@qq.com</span></p>]]></description>
