  <item>
    <title>28.无聊的技能又增加了，盘点我们身上的“无用能力”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ca67d5a56ca3e0c4dfecd5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68ca67d5a56ca3e0c4dfecd5</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 17 Sep 2025 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>小时候总会想要有一些特殊能力</span></p><span></span><p><span>比如武侠片中大侠的“动耳神功”</span></p><span></span><p><span>洞察人心的“读心术“</span></p><span></span><p><span>但随着我们的长大，各自也赋予了与小时候想象中截然不同的能力</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然这些能力或有用或无用</span></p><span></span><p><span>但不妨碍它带给我们很多啼笑皆非的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家扫描下方二维码，或wx搜索Mycxyxb，添加小助手，拉你进听友群。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqxZgZr0j1FL4ZYyNf_Ro-Oj-Hpz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> 听觉嗅觉灵敏的像狗；很会开车‘闹钟响了能立马起床</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="808">13:28</a> 排队永远选错队；让路永远和别人一个方向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="948">15:48</a> 能随时放屁；大拇指能弯折到手臂上；逛街很快</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1193">19:53</a> 陌生环境会激发出强大社交力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1274">21:14</a> 对于结交好友方面有着“一眼万年”的能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1566">26:06</a> 想象力丰富，热衷于玩真人版“奇迹暖暖“，当然也翻车过</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2147">35:47</a> 睡眠达人，导致经常迟到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2368">39:28</a> 分享欲能让我心情变好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2468">41:08</a> 选择性耳聋，可以屏蔽掉自己不想听的声音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2535">42:15</a> 有一些特殊能力其实会给自身造成困扰</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期歌单】</span></p><span></span><p><span>千言万语（A Thousand Words）-陶喆</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、Apple Podcasts、荔枝、蜻蜓FM、QQ音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="mailto:490368444@qq.com"><span>490368444@qq.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
