  <item>
    <title>26.行政VS临床：同一家医院，不同的世界</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68b836a35faf368659dadf8d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68b836a35faf368659dadf8d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Sep 2025 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>其实告诉大家一个秘密</span></p><span></span><p><span>在医院里，行政和临床经常“水火不容“</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天，我们又又又邀请到了我们的嘉宾——甲鱼同学。</span></p><span></span><p><span>她作为医院临床医生，将跟阿梅一起归为医院“临床“阵营</span></p><span></span><p><span>而明月和彩霞将作为“行政“阵营</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们将展开一场互相看不顺眼的“开杠“辩论赛</span></p><span></span><p><span>用双视角来对大家大吐特吐各自的苦水</span></p><span></span><p><span>互相感受对方的认知差异</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家扫描下方二维码，或wx搜索Mycxyxb，添加小助手，拉你进听友群。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqxZgZr0j1FL4ZYyNf_Ro-Oj-Hpz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="114">01:54</a> 临床吐槽：行政难道不就是喝茶看报的闲职吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a> 行政吐槽：加班非常临时，还不算进上班天数</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="884">14:44</a> 问临床要资料比登天还难</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1094">18:14</a> 被行政要求写新闻稿，每个层级提出800个意见，最后发表署名还被抢了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1689">28:09</a> 可怕又紧张的医院评级</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1819">30:19</a> 医院规定说变就变，想一出是一出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2125">35:25</a> 刚入社会的小护士去办公室盖章被刁难</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2335">38:55</a> 好累啊，不想再跟人沟通了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> 想要问临床要新闻稿，临床把我当备忘录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2985">49:45</a> 行政和临床在处理投诉过程有不同立场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3177">52:57</a> 行政是道歉最多的科室</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3340">55:40</a> 病人找院长，行政两头难</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3483">58:03</a> 临床和行政为啥“水火不容”</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期歌单】</span></p><span></span><p><span>面面-方大同</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、Apple Podcasts、荔枝、蜻蜓FM、QQ音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="mailto:490368444@qq.com"><span>490368444@qq.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
