    <guid isPermaLink="false">68af9e0a97178f08ee01a885</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Aug 2025 00:12:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目我们来聊一聊自己与身边人经历过的相亲故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>奇葩相亲对象真的够大家喝好几壶的</span></p><span></span><p><span>还有相亲的边界感到底在哪里</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么一相亲就会默认双方已经在一起啊</span></p><span></span><p><span>免责声明：本期主播们的主观思想非常强</span></p><span></span><p><span>只是我们当下的第一感想的表达</span></p><span></span><p><span>微有mean感，感觉到冒犯请见谅</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家扫描下方二维码，或wx搜索Mycxyxb，添加小助手，拉你进听友群。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="88">01:28</a> 线上口嗨线下哑火，男人我搞不懂你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="694">11:34</a> 年收入百万霸总的妈妈看上我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1111">18:31</a> 跟头皮屑男孩在德克士</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1492">24:52</a> 见面第二次，就迫不及待要牵手了，被我肘飞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1672">27:52</a> 大晚上殷勤送杨梅，我真的不想见你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1896">31:36</a> 国内外的亲密关系界定差距好大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2012">33:32</a> 相亲还是拉练？男生带我一晚暴走2W步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2329">38:49</a> 初中同学的妈妈要撮合，被外公拦住</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2390">39:50</a> 相亲要注重仪表，起码得洗个头吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2488">41:28</a> 为何现在年轻人不喜欢相亲</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期歌单】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Rosy(Live)-方大同</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jack Rabbit Slim’s Twist Contest/You Never Can Tell-Jerome Patrick Hoban/Uma Thurman/Chuck Berry</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、Apple Podcasts、荔枝、蜻蜓FM、QQ音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="mailto:490368444@qq.com"><span>490368444@qq.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
