  <item>
    <title>24.天呐！太牛了！我竟然生下了一个孩子</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68a583a7293471fed490e6aa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68a583a7293471fed490e6aa</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 20 Aug 2025 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目我们来聊一下自己成为妈妈的过程</span></p><span></span><p><span>从备孕到生产都充满了艰辛</span></p><span></span><p><span>痛苦和成长都是相辅相成的</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家不要畏惧怀孕和生产</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为我们女性就是这么厉害！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家扫描下方二维码，或wx搜索Mycxyxb，添加小助手，拉你进听友群。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqxZgZr0j1FL4ZYyNf_Ro-Oj-Hpz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="114">01:54</a> 是什么想让我们成为一名妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="175">02:55</a> 拔牙也是备孕的步骤之一</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">08:43</a> 备孕不能过度焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="604">10:04</a> 知道怀孕以后的心境是怎样的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="957">15:57</a> 整个孕期简直太难受了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1606">26:46</a> 职场言语霸凌时刻：孕妇的安全比不上要高考的主任儿子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1838">30:38</a> 孕中期频繁假性宫缩，健身被叫停</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2127">35:27</a> 足月后闲不住，实在想卸货</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2243">37:23</a> 怀孕恰逢单位检查，孕妇背锅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2350">39:10</a> 勇敢的明月和阿梅从一开始就想选择顺产</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2427">40:27</a> 阿梅生产日记：宫缩通个半死发现医院竟然没有无痛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2633">43:53</a> 明月生产日记：竟然还有另一个堪比无痛的人类之光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3443">57:23</a> 生孩子的好处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3478">57:58</a> 生孩子后心态上的改变</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期歌单】</span></p><span></span><p><span>这条小鱼在乎（I’m a little fish）-王OK/洪佩瑜</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱我吧（Live）-方大同</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、Apple Podcasts、荔枝、蜻蜓FM、QQ音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="mailto:490368444@qq.com"><span>490368444@qq.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
