  <item>
    <title>23.医师节特辑：嘘！泌尿外科医生告诉你嘘嘘的秘密</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/689c7fda759c1ff652c045fc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">689c7fda759c1ff652c045fc</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 13 Aug 2025 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>泌尿外科=男科？</span></p><span></span><p><span>一天是不是一定要喝八杯水？</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么女性更容易患泌尿系统疾病？</span></p><span></span><p><span>正值医师节来临之际</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目隆重邀请到一位“特别嘉宾”——主播明月的家属俞老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>来看看泌尿外科医生的日常是怎样的</span></p><span></span><p><span>俞老师也分享了很多工作中的无奈、好笑的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span>公立医院的医生居然是冷漠的热血心肠</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家扫描下方的二维码或搜索Mycxyxb添加小助手微信，拉你进听友群噢</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqxZgZr0j1FL4ZYyNf_Ro-Oj-Hpz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">00:56</a> 嘉宾介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">01:19</a> 医生在医师节都在干嘛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="226">03:46</a> 泌尿外科和男科的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="284">04:44</a> 泌尿外科缺少女医生是否造成女性就医困难</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="447">07:27</a> 男女泌尿系统有何却别？女性是否更容易患泌尿外科疾病？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="591">09:51</a> 是否需要一天八杯水？俞老师带你解答一些泌尿外科的小问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="722">12:02</a> 为何选择医疗这个行业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1152">19:12</a> 做医生希望有高光时刻，但是更多的只有日常的暖心时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1375">22:55</a> 泌尿外科是八卦最多的科室之一？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1414">23:34</a> 小男孩意外负伤需要摘除部分器官</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1534">25:34</a> 医生那些心不甘情不愿的加班时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1739">28:59</a> 处理投诉的问题，临床和行政真的有壁？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2094">34:54</a> 医疗行业看尽世间冷暖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2425">40:25</a> 没钱做结石手术却去割了双眼皮，做了植发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2588">43:08</a> 冷漠的公立医院医生说不定才是最想把你的病看好的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期歌单】</span></p><span></span><p><span>I Don‘t Need No Doctor-JohnScofield/John Mayer</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、Apple Podcasts、荔枝、蜻蜓FM、QQ音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="mailto:490368444@qq.com"><span>490368444@qq.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
