    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>❤感谢瑞典专业益生菌品牌</span><strong><span>【LactiPlus乐芙乐斯】</span></strong><span>对本期节目的支持</span></p><span></span><p><span>购买LactiPlus乐芙乐斯肠胃宝，请认准小红书、天猫、京东品牌旗舰店</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目非常的“有味道”</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们要来聊一下肠胃的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>突发的腹痛总是会不经意地影响我们</span></p><span></span><p><span>甚至扰乱我们的日常生活</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播们因为突发的肠胃不适究竟引发了哪些糗事呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【听友群】</span></p><span></span><p><span>扫描下方二维码或搜索Mycxyxb，添加小助手微信，拉你进听友群哟！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqxZgZr0j1FL4ZYyNf_Ro-Oj-Hpz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>肠胃不仅仅是消化器官，也是很重要的免疫、排毒乃至情绪器官。</span></p><span></span><p><u><strong><span>对肠脑轴的深入了解，能够为你解答很多困扰多时的肠胃问题。</span></strong></u></p><span></span><p><span>益生菌补充不是靠“量大出奇迹”，进一步了解菌株及其他营养成分的搭配，才是选择一款好产品的硬道理！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnybOkXuHyjkby_PQ1MYgfcvqK8o.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">2:35</a> 倒霉的夜班，遇上了很多腹痛腹泻的病人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">4:40</a> 一个打狂犬疫苗的病人突然“发疯“，惹得其他病患找来了帽子叔叔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="637">10:37</a> 每逢人生关键时刻就想跑厕所</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1444">24:04</a> 电视剧诚不欺我，知道前任劈腿，突然恶心想吐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1472">24:32</a> 科普：胃溃疡和十二指肠溃疡的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1651">27:31</a> 惨遭菱角的“报复“</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2142">35:42</a> 益生菌应该如何补充</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2300">38:20</a> 宝宝半夜上吐下泻吓坏妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2541">42:21</a> 一起出去旅游，怎么肠道功能强弱差这么多啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于LactiPlus乐芙乐斯】</span></p><span></span><p><span>LactiPlus乐芙乐斯于1998年诞生于瑞典，近30年历史专研肠胃健康，系列产品进驻了北欧3000+家连锁药店，是北欧TOP2的益生菌品牌。</span></p><span></span><p><span>品牌成立以来，持续和加拿大拉曼营养、法国PiLeJe实验室、意大利Actial等全球性益生菌供应链合作，在菌株安全性、配方专业性及产品品质方面严格保持高标准。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2024年于CBME国际婴童展上首次亮相中国，即被大会推荐为“北欧宝藏品牌”。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrGR4vsYIrxSuZXTlic6CQ5pheqg.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【听友专属·限时福利】</span></p><span></span><p><span>史无前例，买一赠一！</span></p><span></span><p><span>即刻前往品牌小红书、天猫、京东旗舰店，</span><u><strong><span>购买任意正装，备注“明月彩霞要下班”，确认收货后即可获赠品牌经典王牌产品【肠胃宝】体验装一盒（订单收货后由旗舰店单独寄出）</span></strong></u><span>。多买多赠，赠品可叠加~</span></p><span></span><p><span>活动有效期至：2025年9月15日</span></p><span></span><p><span>❤本次活动最终解释权归品牌方所有</span></p><span></span><p><span>注意：本品为普通食品，不能替代药品。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期歌单】</span></p><span></span><p><span>芭乐-FunkyMo</span></p><span></span><p><span>Deadman-蔡徐坤</span></p><span></span><p><span>It’s Only A Paper Moon-Pual McCartney</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tokyo-Lianne La Havas</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jazz Man-Beth Hart</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、Apple Podcasts、荔枝、蜻蜓FM、QQ音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="mailto:490368444@qq.com"><span>490368444@qq.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>菌株功效资料来源：</span></p><span></span><p><span>[1] Peran, L. et al. (2007). “A comparative study of the preventative effects exerted by threeprobiotics, Bifidobacterium lactis, Lactobacillus casei and Lactobacillusacidophilus, in the TNBS model of rat colitis”. Journal Of Applied Microbiology 103: 836–844.</span></p><span></span><p><span>[2] Pang, G. (2005). “A comparative study of probiotic bacterial strains in vitro and invivo”. School of Biomedical Sciences, University of Newcastle, NSW(Internal Report).</span></p><span></span><p><span>[3] L.M.Forster.(2001).“A comprehensive post-market review of studies on a probiotic productcontaining_Lactobacillus helveticus R0052 and Lactobacillus rhamnosus R0011”.Benificial Microbes 2(4):319-334</span></p><span></span><p><span>[4] Caroline J.K. Wallace(2021).“The Efficacy, Safety, and Tolerability of Probiotics on Depression:Clinical Results From an Open-Label Pilot Study”.</span></p><span></span><p><span>[5] PiLeJe Laboratoire(2022). “Lactobacillus gasseri LA806Supplementation in Patients with Irritable Bowel Syndrome: A Multicenter Study”.J.Clin.Med.2023,11,7446.</span><a href="https://doi.org/10.3390/jcm11247446" data-url="https://doi.org/10.3390/jcm11247446"><span>doi.org</span></a></p>]]></description>
