  <item>
    <title>Vol.21 在医院长大的日子，实习期笑泪史&amp;生存指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6889d6688e06fe8de77028d4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6889d6688e06fe8de77028d4</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 30 Jul 2025 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目来和大家聊聊我们三个人进入医院的懵懂初经历</span></p><span></span><p><span>成长就是一步一个脚印</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于在医院见习和实习期，这段经历到底有多少槽点和成长？</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家扫描下方的二维码或搜索Mycxyxb添加小助手微信，拉你进听友群噢~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqxZgZr0j1FL4ZYyNf_Ro-Oj-Hpz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="113">1:53</a> 彩霞作为一名非医护的见习人员，第一次开大会战战兢兢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="513">8:33</a> 实习生初入职场，因为没有喊前辈老师而被教育了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="616">10:16</a> &nbsp;试用期第一天找人签字，文件被众目睽睽之下甩到地上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="995">16:35</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;领导通病，话说一半，自己理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1107">18:27</a> 实习护士就是“贷款”上班</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1195">19:55</a> 原来不能盯着工作人员的胸牌看</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1259">20:59</a> 带教老师告诫实习生们不要学护理，赶紧转行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1375">22:55</a> 阿梅第一次打针，手抖成筛子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 发现患者回血，大惊失色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1564">26:04</a> 实习生被禁止使用医院电梯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1687">28:07</a> 护士会熬夜是基操</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1817">30:17</a> 带教老师突然考核测量血压，结果测出一个惊人数值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1955">32:35</a> 差点以为病人的引流袋液体大量流出是自己导致的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2175">36:15</a> 医生非常在意自己的级别，千万不能搞错了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2325">38:45</a> 工作完成的时间有小“窍门”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2589">43:09</a> 职场中的暖心时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2702">45:02</a> 急诊遇上驱车100公里的家长带孩子拔鱼刺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2916">48:36</a> 下夜班赤脚走在满是石子的路上，好想哭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3040">50:40</a> 打工人实用建议清单（其实是偷懒的）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期歌单】</span></p><span></span><p><span>**** the world-Richard Cheese</span></p><span></span><p><span>DUMB-Noga Erez</span></p><span></span><p><span>Extraterrestrial Heart（天外之心）-Brian Cheng</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、Apple Podcasts、荔枝、蜻蜓FM、QQ音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="mailto:490368444@qq.com"><span>490368444@qq.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
